              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "house3064"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is a great creamy beer cheese soup that can be customized to anyone's liking. Sometimes we top this soup with cheese, sour cream and bacon. Other times with cheese, pico de gio, and green onions. NOTE: There is an error in the recipe. It says 1/4 cup cornstarch and I believe it was meant to be a 1/4 teaspoon. Past that, it is a great recipe we have and will continue to make. Thanks stopping the years of searching for our perfect cheese soup recipe!"
          },
